import lib/graphics.dl

exposed function record the graphics scroll of {C string:window} with horizontal offset {floating-point number:x} and vertical offset {floating-point number:y}:
    execute:
        print x as a line
        print y as a line

record the graphics scroll of 0 as a pointer to a byte with horizontal offset 1.25 and vertical offset (0.0 - 2.5)
